    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p7_b12",
      "text": "1) Clinical Breast Ultrasound Dataset: In this study, we\nuse a private clinical image dataset provided by Peking Union\nMedical College Hospital for algorithm evaluation. The dataset\ncomprises 559 aligned ultrasound images, categorizing lesions\ninto Cancer (CA, 291 images) and Sclerosing Adenosis (SA,\n268 images). Each image is accompanied by a precise binary\nsegmentation mask delineating the lesion region. The dataset\nis randomly partitioned into training and validation sets at an\n8:2 ratio.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.96,
        642.51,
        300.02,
        748.29
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        195,
        2570,
        1200,
        2993
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 496,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p7_b13",
      "text": "2) ISIC 2016 [59] and ISIC 2018 Datasets [60]:\nTo\nevaluate our method on dermoscopic imagery, we utilized the\nISIC 2016 and ISIC 2018 datasets. The ISIC 2016 dataset\nincludes 900 training and 379 testing images, while ISIC 2018\nprovides a larger collection of 2,594 images.\n",
      "bbox": [
        311.98,
        505.96,
        563.04,
        563.92
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        1247,
        2023,
        2252,
        2255
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 273,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p7_b14",
      "text": "3) BUSI Dataset [61]:\nThe Breast Ultrasound Images\n(BUSI) dataset consists of 697 images (487 benign and 210\nmalignant). Original DICOM images were converted to PNG\nand transformed to grayscale prior to our standardized resizing\nprotocol.\n",
      "bbox": [
        311.98,
        567.42,
        563.04,
        625.37
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        1247,
        2269,
        2252,
        2501
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 238,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p7_b15",
      "text": "4) Colonic Polyp Dataset: We curated a comprehensive\ndataset encompassing 3,784 endoscopic images by aggregating\nsamples from five benchmarks: CVC-ClinicDB [62], CVC-\nColonDB [63], ETIS-LaribPolypDB [64], Kvasir [65], and\nPolypGen [66]\u2013[68]. The training/validation split followed an\n8:2 ratio.\n5) MRI Brain Tumor Dataset [69]:\nWe incorporated\nthe LGG Segmentation Dataset from The Cancer Imaging\nArchive, comprising 3,929 brain MRI images. Experimental\nsettings remain consistent with the Colonic Polyp dataset.\n",
